  "summary": {
    "value": "Orukeet is a 25-language speech recognizer built from NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3. It replaces half of the encoder's temporal depthwise filters with 12,288 fitted, frozen Gabor kernels and trains the remaining parameters on multilingual and multi-accent data.",
